  "notes": [
    "\"breaks … with a super strong candle\" = ALL of: (opens below ANY of the 5 lines) AND (closes above ALL 5 lines) AND (body ≥ 1.5 × ATR(14)), per your answers.",
    "Line values are the values on the signal candle itself (as drawn on the chart).",
    "ATR(14) is read from the previous bar, so the strong candle is compared with the volatility before it rather than inflating its own threshold. Change 'bars ago' to 0 in the controls if you meant otherwise.",
